OL,3,GNEWSATiny island's plea for 'workers
OL,4,Aand children' after huge interest in
OL,5,Atwo new homes
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Orkney island of Eday is eight
OL,8,Fmiles long, two miles wide and it is
OL,9,Fhome to just 120 people.
OL,11,FIt has its own community shop, a ferry
OL,12,Fterminal and even an airfield and
OL,13,Fterminal building called "London
OL,14,FAirport".
OL,16,FBut the islanders desperately need new
OL,17,Ffamilies to fill their school, staff
OL,18,Ftheir fire station and care for their
OL,19,Felderly.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
